{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子でごわす(｀・∀・´)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにきて、いよいよ\nおきまりのブログ冒頭あいさつを\nふざけだしました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふざけるとこも増やしていこうかなと思います。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、第一弾のおふざけとして\nしばらく冒頭お決まりあいさつを\nふざけていこうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで、\n皆さんが考えた冒頭おふざけあいさつを募集します！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなにくだらなくても\nどんなにつまらなくても\nどんなに重要的でも\nどんなに面白くても\n何でもいいので是非、日奈子に伝授してください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメントから、ひろって\n使いたいと思います(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/03/5400000/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/03/5400000/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外ハネ\nりんごヘアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の中で流行ってます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/03/5400000/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日経エンタテインメント！\nアイドルSpecial 2016"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p